cting our fallen members. Please respect our control of this area and leave at once. I have to admit your presence here is making me a bit nervous. We don't want any trouble.' They stare at you fearfully, '\"So, are you going to leave us in peace, or did you come [expecting a fight]?'\nYou say, 'We were expecting a fight'\n[Name of NPC] says 'I should have known the trial of corruption wouldn't be so easy. Bring it on!'\n_The trial has begun. You cannot bring additional people into your expedition at this time._\nThree waves of NPCs will spawn (6, 12, 18) which act much like real players and come in eight different classes. All NPCs are level 70. Kill them and collect your reward:\n_Shell of the Corrupted spawns afterward with a number of different loot possibilities._\n_Upon completion, you will also receive a Mastery of Power Rune, one of six pieces needed for Citadel of Anguish access._\n**What are the lockout timers?**\n**Submitted by:** Saraban, Darkwind\n- Bracelet of the Corrupter [item=32665]\n- Bracer of Corrupted Souls [item=32667]\n- Bracer of the Debauched [item=32703]\n- Brittle Blade of Strategy [item=67882]\n- Brittle Blade of Tactics [item=58142]\n- Ceremonial Battle Boots [item=67881]\n- Cloak of the Faithless [item=32700]\n- Cord of the Malcontent [item=32701]\n- Darkiron Bow of Betrayal [item=32485]\n- Fangs of the Serpent [item=32702]\n- Glowing Muramite Rune [item=30539]\n- Greater Muramite Rune [item=30538]\n- Howling Bloodstained Bulwark [item=32666]\n- Mastery of Power Rune [item=33016]\n- Screaming Skull of Discontent [item=32668]\n- Seal: Mastery of All [item=33023]\n- Shawl of Nefarious Favor [item=32482]\n- Wristband of Spectral Corruption [item=32704]",
