r spawns with the loot._\n**Need all dialogues, /loc of quest-giver, emotes during fight, time limit for expedition, lockout timers for success and failure, minimum group size to get expedition.**\n- Eyepatch of Expert Archery [item=32902]\n- Girdle of Efficiency [item=32663]\n- Glowing Muramite Rune [item=30539]\n- Greater Muramite Rune [item=30538]\n- Journal of the Prime Disciple [item=35121]\n- Rime-Encrusted Pikestaff [item=31942]",
