cale trials or do you wish to enroll in Subversion or Foresight?'\nYou say, 'Foresight'\nProjection of Tactics says, 'Perception and split-second reactions are not something you can acquire in training. It's a gift learned on the battlefield, and the penalty for being a slow learner is a quick and decisive death. Can you see the arrow as it sails towards your heart and sidestep out of the way? If you have this ability now is the opportunity to prove your worth.'\n_You have entered Proving Grounds: Mastery of Foresight._\nYou say, 'Hail, Master of Foresight'\nMaster of Foresight says, 'This is the Mastery of Foresight Trial. You must react quickly to deadly and unforgiving hazards. Are you ready to [begin]?'\nYou say, 'We are ready to begin'\nMaster of Foresight says, 'Very well ! Let the battle commence !\"\n_The trial has begun. You cannot bring additional people into your expedition at this time._\nAs you enter the room, you see six Dragorns on the smaller platforms (Dragorn Annihilator, Adept, Flamecaster, Spellscribe, Incinerator, Acolyte, all lvl 70). Once all six are down, you win. Meanwhile you get orders to do stuff. If you don't obey you will get punished by the Kyv Sureshots.\n_Shell of the the Master spawns afterward with loot for the raid._\n_Also upon completion, you will also receive a Mastery of Tactics Rune, one of six pieces needed for Citadel of Anguish access._\n**Submitted by:** Saraban, Darkwind\n- Band of Eternal Gaze [item=32421]\n- Belt of Intangible Clairvoyance [item=32420]\n- Cudgel of the Watchful Dragorn [item=32674]\n- Glowing Muramite Rune [item=30539]\n- Greater Muramite Rune [item=30538]\n- Hammered Helm of Foresight [item=32690]\n- Headband of Heightened Cognizance [item=32676]\n- Helm of Inventive Perception [item=32691]\n- Mask of Uncanny Sight [item=32722]\n- Mastery of Tactics Rune [item=33018]\n- Misty Globe [item=32689]\n- Pendant of Stilled Time [item=32422]\n- Seal: Mastery of All [item=33023]\n- Thunderclap [item=32675]\n- 